{"id":"n40637-1-6","stage":5,"title":"내비치다 · 透光","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40637-1-6-1","ko":"이제 비가 그치려나 봐.","zh":"看来雨要停了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그치려나","meaning":"停止，结束","explanation":"그치다：停止，结束；려나：表示对未来情况的疑问或推测。","readings":[{"term":"그치다","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29775","senseId":"1","lemma":"그치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"d2e1c5743fe04efc","term":"그치다","zh":"停止，结束","audio":"/audio/d2e1c5743fe04efc2512.mp3","entryId":"29775","definition":"一直持续的事情、动作、现象等不再继续，停下来。","pronunciation":["그치다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/edc8f718374dea37454a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40637-1-6-2","ko":"응. 구름 사이로 햇살이 내비치는 걸 보니 이제 비 안 오겠다.","zh":"嗯，从云层间透出的阳光来看，应该不会再下雨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구름","meaning":"云，云彩","explanation":"구름：云，云彩","readings":[{"term":"구름","audio":"/audio/f6b5fe269180f148aa13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64487","senseId":"1","lemma":"구름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이로","meaning":"间，之间，间距","explanation":"사이：间，之间，间距；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"햇살이","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇살：阳光，日光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"햇살","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72477","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내비치는","meaning":"透光，透亮","explanation":"내비치다：透光，透亮；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"내비치다","audio":"/audio/c586eda86d24c952765a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40637","senseId":"1","lemma":"내비치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오겠다.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"f6b5fe269180f148","term":"구름","zh":"云，云彩","audio":"/audio/f6b5fe269180f148aa13.mp3","entryId":"64487","definition":"空气中的小水滴或冰粒凝结在一起，飘浮在空中。","pronunciation":["구름"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，间距","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从一个物体到另一个物体，或从一处到另一处的距离或空间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"1436beae29371a85","term":"햇살","zh":"阳光，日光","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3","entryId":"72477","definition":"太阳发射的光线。","pronunciation":["해쌀","핻쌀"]},{"id":"c586eda86d24c952","term":"내비치다","zh":"透光，透亮","audio":"/audio/c586eda86d24c952765a.mp3","entryId":"40637","definition":"光向外射出而可见。","pronunciation":["내ː비치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5fe779900ad9444c7c6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.265,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40637","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，从云层间透出的阳光来看，应该不会再下雨了。","请尝尝这杯水吧。这对身体非常有益的饮品哦。","看来雨要停了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，从云层间透出的阳光来看，应该不会再下雨了。","看来雨要停了。","请尝尝这杯水吧。这对身体非常有益的饮品哦。"],"answer":0}]}
